        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3098140/extras/70391bcc9e651cb972245ea2593f03af.avif?t=1775650578\" width=1559 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3098140/extras/a8cc5cd20c9608867f9b1dc41d9feb24.poster.avif?t=1775650578\" width=1170 height=570 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3098140/extras/a8cc5cd20c9608867f9b1dc41d9feb24.webm?t=1775650578\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3098140/extras/a8cc5cd20c9608867f9b1dc41d9feb24.mp4?t=1775650578\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to a vast and fantasy-style medieval world full of danger and excitement.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 50 alignments are contending in this land, and various content and epic drama await your exploration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3098140/extras/fb020ec25a3badeaa3a9d5a8a4422a96.avif?t=1775650578\" width=677 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A thousand soldiers are fighting on a battlefield with a classical top-down view. Deploy different soldiers, command squad attack in real-time, release skills, and use items. Use your tactic to influence the war! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3098140/extras/295ec87d81b64dfc352f799794001db2.poster.avif?t=1775650578\" width=780 height=470 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3098140/extras/295ec87d81b64dfc352f799794001db2.webm?t=1775650578\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3098140/extras/295ec87d81b64dfc352f799794001db2.mp4?t=1775650578\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3098140/extras/14a6d2dc83307b551a26ddaf8ef030f8.avif?t=1775650578\" width=677 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 50 characters for players to recruit, try to improve relationships and recruit them for your adventure. 8 classes combine with vast equipment builds, try to develop your favorite heroes by anyways. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3098140/extras/9f3a40e396e0b370cd2c564cbe60c3f1.poster.avif?t=1775650578\" width=780 height=470 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3098140/extras/9f3a40e396e0b370cd2c564cbe60c3f1.webm?t=1775650578\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3098140/extras/9f3a40e396e0b370cd2c564cbe60c3f1.mp4?t=1775650578\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3098140/extras/66af194b3d5cb2b456d8e297d9bc7cab.avif?t=1775650578\" width=677 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Based on the fantasy medieval design, players can experience different races and civilizations on a vast map, meet partners with various abilities from around the world, take on diverse missions and adventures, and challenge powerful bosses everywhere! <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3098140/extras/0cc446bcaa66ee64cd3d50688679c680.poster.avif?t=1775650578\" width=780 height=470 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3098140/extras/0cc446bcaa66ee64cd3d50688679c680.webm?t=1775650578\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3098140/extras/0cc446bcaa66ee64cd3d50688679c680.mp4?t=1775650578\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3098140/extras/375a66bfb86124111e14d9e306ac3cf1.avif?t=1775650578\" width=677 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After gaining territory, players can manage cities, build constructions, expand faction, and conquer the world. Face the crisis, create a legend!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3098140/extras/2bc51990b958dede67496bfa52432691.poster.avif?t=1775650578\" width=780 height=470 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3098140/extras/2bc51990b958dede67496bfa52432691.webm?t=1775650578\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3098140/extras/2bc51990b958dede67496bfa52432691.mp4?t=1775650578\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Embrace the call of destiny and embark on an epic journey!</h2>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3098140/extras/70391bcc9e651cb972245ea2593f03af.avif?t=1775650578\" width=1559 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3098140/extras/a8cc5cd20c9608867f9b1dc41d9feb24.poster.avif?t=1775650578\" width=1170 height=570 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3098140/extras/a8cc5cd20c9608867f9b1dc41d9feb24.webm?t=1775650578\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3098140/extras/a8cc5cd20c9608867f9b1dc41d9feb24.mp4?t=1775650578\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to a vast and fantasy-style medieval world full of danger and excitement.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 50 alignments are contending in this land, and various content and epic drama await your exploration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3098140/extras/fb020ec25a3badeaa3a9d5a8a4422a96.avif?t=1775650578\" width=677 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A thousand soldiers are fighting on a battlefield with a classical top-down view. Deploy different soldiers, command squad attack in real-time, release skills, and use items. Use your tactic to influence the war! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3098140/extras/295ec87d81b64dfc352f799794001db2.poster.avif?t=1775650578\" width=780 height=470 ><source src=\