iverse missions and adventures, and challenge powerful bosses everywhere! <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3098140/extras/0cc446bcaa66ee64cd3d50688679c680.poster.avif?t=1775650578\" width=780 height=470 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3098140/extras/0cc446bcaa66ee64cd3d50688679c680.webm?t=1775650578\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3098140/extras/0cc446bcaa66ee64cd3d50688679c680.mp4?t=1775650578\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3098140/extras/375a66bfb86124111e14d9e306ac3cf1.avif?t=1775650578\" width=677 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After gaining territory, players can manage cities, build constructions, expand faction, and conquer the world. Face the crisis, create a legend!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3098140/extras/2bc51990b958dede67496bfa52432691.poster.avif?t=1775650578\" width=780 height=470 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3098140/extras/2bc51990b958dede67496bfa52432691.webm?t=1775650578\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3098140/extras/2bc51990b958dede67496bfa52432691.mp4?t=1775650578\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Embrace the call of destiny and embark on an epic journey!</h2>",
